  "ingredients": [
    "2 (15 ounce) cans pear halves",
    "1 (3 ounce) package lime flavored Jell-O® mix",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened",
    "2 tablespoons milk",
    "1 (8 ounce) container frozen whipped topping, thawed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sRu4vFzrzgVoFUTz8eCjh3SCjmQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14197-sea-foam-salad-VAT-005-step-01-4df22afbfcf844d2a595c9ec1376faad.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14197/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a small saucepan, heat 1 cup reserved pear juice to boiling. Pour over lime gelatin in a small bowl; stir until dissolved. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OUE7zNVmcOGWs7xcAvSVWjCYkIM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14197-sea-foam-salad-VAT-006-step-02-78c6cca212514345a9ca88524293d360.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14197/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, beat cream cheese with milk until smooth. Blend in gelatin mixture. Chill in the refrigerator until partially thickened, about 20 to 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yDRaWecMYTyzZejVE2kRPF45kYk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14197-sea-foam-salad-VAT-007-step-03-2267b455c46e4f03a8d64f70628790c5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14197/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a small bowl, mash pears until smooth. Fold pears and whipped topping into gelatin mixture. Pour into a mold. Chill until set, about 2 to 3 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1eaK3Ojza-8MDUKinch-pPExerA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14197-sea-foam-salad-VAT-008-step-04-231d84b213e04557932d158b8972e8f5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14197/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dip mold in warm water for approximately 5 seconds. Invert onto a serving plate",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wiIjVaC4eDRNkrI7yRH0kPdCrF8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/14197-sea-foam-salad-VAT-009-step-05-92762e99984e4a69be45bd80f82c3c73.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/14197/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
